Upstream bug: files_settings only routes POST /v1/files. On provider-only
retrieve, content, delete, and list calls the proxy falls back to a team
deployment's credentials or the environment, so a file uploaded to the
files_settings backend cannot be read, listed, or deleted through the proxy.

No upstream report yet.

Apply the provider's files_settings entry after the team credentials on those
four fallbacks, as create_file already does. Without files_settings, nothing
changes.

Removal check: files_settings routing check in tests/verify_files_settings.py

diff --git a/litellm/proxy/openai_files_endpoints/files_endpoints.py b/litellm/proxy/openai_files_endpoints/files_endpoints.py
